<title>POLAND: POLISH SENATE STARTS VOTE ON PERSONAL TAXES.</title>
<headline>POLISH SENATE STARTS VOTE ON PERSONAL TAXES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Senate began voting whether to approve the lower house's tax bill or adopt one of several proposed amendments, the Senate deputy speaker said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
